{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ca605922-8948-86ff-bcc4-6e1e7099fbd8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T10:36:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Merry Christmas Eve, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Vincent Barone. I'm calling about the streetlights. I got it written down here, hold on, I'm on the speaker so you tell me if you can't hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, Mr. Barone. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Um, [pause] here. The whole block lost its lights at night. Sunday, Monday, and last night too. Every light on the street, dark. Not one, all of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:33:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All of them, wow. And what street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:33:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 244 Old Beach Road. Down toward Easton's Beach side, you know, past where it bends."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:33:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. 244 Old Beach Road. So I'm writing, whole block out after dark, three nights running. Is it the lights on both sides of the street or just one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:34:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. Well, hold on. [pause] I wrote it down. The pole right in front of my house, the one with the number tag on it, that's the one that buzzes. It was buzzing before it went out. Then everything went."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:34:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, buzzing pole in front of your place. Can you read me the tag number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me see, I gotta put my glasses on. [pause] I can't read it from the window. It's dark out there when I look, and I'm not going out on the ice. Just have the crew look at the pole. That's what I'm asking, send somebody to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:34:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I'll put in for a crew to check the pole in front of 244 and note that the whole block is dark. They can find the tag themselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because it's a nuisance, I'll tell you. My wife and I walk in the morning, and when it's icy we go over to the recreation center, they got the indoor track. We use that. But we gotta get there and back, and it's pitch black at five o'clock on this street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good with the ice around. I'm noting it's a safety issue for walkers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:35:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. I called, hold on, I don't think I called before. No. This is the first time on this one. I just figured somebody would notice by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'd think so. Sometimes it's a utility feed problem and sometimes it's the city's fixture, so the crew will sort out which. Do you want a call back, or just the work order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call me back if you need. It's 401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0177, got it. Vincent Barone, 244 Old Beach Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Barone, B-A-R-O-N-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I have it. Now, with the holiday, I can't tell you exactly when they'll get out there. I've marked it as a whole-block outage so it should go near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Near the top. Okay. I'd like it today, but okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If it's still dark tonight, call back and we'll add it to the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thank you, Kevin. Have a good holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Barone. Stay off that ice."
    }
  ],
